      "endFrameExclusive": 99,
      "text": "我们盼着回归，已经十年了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "2",
      "startSeconds": 5.3,
      "endSeconds": 8.82,
      "startFrame": 159,
      "endFrameExclusive": 265,
      "text": "我忘不了爸爸。周延也忘不了他的班长。"
    },
    {
      "id": "3",
      "startSeconds": 13.0,
      "endSeconds": 16.92,
      "startFrame": 390,
      "endFrameExclusive": 508,
      "text": "地球的援军正在靠近。邵原，也要逃了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "4",
      "startSeconds": 18.5,
      "endSeconds": 20.58,
      "startFrame": 555,
      "endFrameExclusive": 618,
      "text": "追上去，还来得及。"
    },
    {
      "id": "5",
      "startSeconds": 23.5,
      "endSeconds": 26.54,
      "startFrame": 705,
      "endFrameExclusive": 797,
      "text": "可我答应过，要把这些人送到。"
    },
    {
      "id": "6",
      "startSeconds": 37.2,
      "endSeconds": 40.12,
      "startFrame": 1116,
      "endFrameExclusive": 1204,
      "text": "这一次，换我守住这扇门。"
